{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_04_end","storyGroup":"act47side","storySort":9,"storyDependence":"act47side_level_act47side_04_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"UR-4","storyName":"晴空湍流","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"梅希亚一面帮高登引开娜斯提，一面帮衰老的女妖寻人。随后，娜斯提收到了那支丢失的骨笔的残片。另一边，高登押着费尔南和奥克里，取道莱茵生态园的地下运输通道，试图将违禁品运出园区。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act47side/level_act47side_04_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act47side_04","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":7,"next":9,"characters":["？？？","疲惫的女声","梅希亚","拂哀菈","费尔南","奥克里","高登","梅兰德特工","斯凯","娜斯提"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":7},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_bg_hotel.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"bg","id":9,"from":"0","to":"0.8","duration":"0","block":"false"},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts","volume":"1","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"抱歉，我来晚了。今天的工作有些忙。","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的女声","text":"梅、梅希亚......请你......","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的女声","text":"我需要......想起，更多......","id":15},{"type":"dialog","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.5","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您的情况很特殊。","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您的记忆像是枯枝上仅存的败叶，拂去灰尘或许能令它们恢复些许色泽，但太过用力，只会造成伤害。","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#9$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.5","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"我甚至不该去拨弄它们的，若不是......","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#9$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.5","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"抱歉，拂哀菈女士。","id":23},{"type":"charslot","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"我需要......知道，需要......想起。","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#8$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.5","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"离开家乡之后的回忆对您来说并不愉快，但如果您坚持......那就闭上眼睛吧，我们继续尝试。","id":27},{"type":"dialog","id":28},{"type":"charslot","id":29},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":30},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bowl_smash","volume":"0.6","id":31},{"type":"text","text":"有些费力地，梅希亚把她总带在身边的那台老旧的幻灯机搬上了桌子。","id":32},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_mgcdevcstartp","volume":"1","id":33},{"type":"text","text":"随着她指尖滑动，玻璃幻灯片落入卡槽，一幅陌生的景象笼罩了女妖衰老的身躯。","id":34},{"type":"dialog","id":35},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":36},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":37},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_bg_44_g4_towerroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":38},{"type":"bg","id":39,"from":"0.8","to":"0","duration":"0","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":40},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_signlntrfrnc","volume":"1","id":41},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_tvnoise","layer":"1","id":42},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.5","keep":"true","id":43},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":44},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","delay":"0.5","id":45},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":46},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"......我记得，那个地方。","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"莱塔尼亚？","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"她......提过。","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"那里，高塔......镣铐，血。","id":51},{"type":"text","text":"缓慢地，模糊地，一段记忆在幻灯机投射出的背景上晕开。梅希亚辨认出一具衰老的身躯被锁在墙边，几个穿着长袍的人影进进出出。","id":52},{"type":"text","text":"一些血的气味，一段可怖的旋律，一些术式的痕迹。","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"莱塔尼亚的高塔，您被囚禁在那里过？......作为实验对象？","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"若不是一位巫妖出手相助，您几乎就要被埋葬在高塔术师的书页之下。","id":55},{"type":"dialog","id":56},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_button","volume":"0.8","id":57},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_bg_26_g5_laterano_chapelout.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"圣城的安魂教堂，您在那里为人送葬？是为您流落在外的同胞，还是为您族群的......仇敌？","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"但那些天使并不领情，对吗？他们的葬礼上需要的是欢笑，而不是您的......哀哭。","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您差点被戍卫队逮捕。","id":61},{"type":"dialog","id":62},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_button","volume":"0.8","id":63},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_bg_29_g2_edgeofbase.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您来到哥伦比亚......是横穿了整片拓荒地，甚至......骸骨荒原？","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"那片野兽都不敢踏足的、被风沙切割得千疮百孔的土地？","id":66},{"type":"dialog","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":69},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"0.5","id":70},{"type":"bgeffect","id":71},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":72},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_bg_hotel.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":74},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#5$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您最后还是来到了这里。","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#7$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"为什么，偏偏是这座园区？您是来寻找什么......","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#1$1","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"这里，这里也有......树。","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#1$1","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"这里的树，也在枯萎、腐败......","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#1$1","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"枯萎、腐败。","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#15$1","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"原来如此。","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#15$1","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"这里的确有一座生态园，它也确实刚刚发生过一场令人不忍注目的事故，枯萎、腐败，如您所说。","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#11$1","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"而那座生态园的主人......","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#11$1","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"是另一位女妖。","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#11$1","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"或许，您认识它吗？","id":96},{"type":"dialog","id":97},{"type":"charslot","id":98},{"type":"text","text":"那支在生态园酿成大祸，后来又被高登收缴的骨笔，就这样洁白无辜地躺在梅希亚的手中。","id":99},{"type":"dialog","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#4$1","duratin":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"......她。","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#4$1","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"她的气息......她在。","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"所以，您是来找人的。","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2035_1#3$1","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拂哀菈","text":"我想......我想见她......","id":108},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":109},{"type":"dialog","id":110},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":111},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"charslot","id":113},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_bg_bg_cherunder_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":114},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":115},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":116},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":117},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":118},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$escape_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_dia_escape_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":119,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0.8","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"不用把身子压得这么低，奥克里，你背上的施术装置已经歪了。","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"这可是莱茵生命的地下通道，说不定连墙壁里都有纳米监听器！","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"再说了，我们还要当心园区的报警系统......既然是帮高登长官办事，为什么还得躲着警卫队？","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"你觉得有几个下属能得到他的完全信任？","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"唔......","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"看电梯的小警卫都有可能是哪位大人物的第三只眼睛。要是出了岔子，牵扯出的问题可比这几箱违禁品严重得多。","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"所以我们这两个没有相关利益的外来人，反倒是替他“销赃”的最佳人选？","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"没错。","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"不过有一个问题我确实想不明白。","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"什么？","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"干活的人有了，接应的人也安排了，那躺在办公室里喂喂鳞兽听听小曲不是更好吗？","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"亲自过来监工可是会惹上麻烦的啊，长官？","id":145},{"type":"dialog","id":146},{"type":"charslot","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","duratin":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"哼，我当然是来为我的小家伙们送行的！","id":149},{"type":"dialog","id":150},{"type":"charslot","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","isblock":"true","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"什么？","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":156},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":158},{"type":"charslot","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","isblock":"true","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"别随便乱晃，蠢货，源石技艺还原装置的保护壳差点就撞墙上了！我跟你们说过，要把这批货看得比自己的命还重。","id":161},{"type":"dialog","id":162},{"type":"charslot","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","isblock":"true","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"当然！","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"那您也一定记得，要是我俩把这些“小家伙们”安全送出去，管好自己的嘴——","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":170},{"type":"charslot","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"我们的账一笔勾销。","id":173},{"type":"dialog","id":174},{"type":"charslot","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","isblock":"true","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"太好了！","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":180},{"type":"charslot","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","isblock":"true","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"别掉以轻心。娜斯提不愿撤出生态园，宁愿面对满墙失败品也要继续研究，甚至昼夜不停。","id":183},{"type":"dialog","id":184},{"type":"charslot","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","isblock":"true","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"所以她现在就在我们的头顶上？我好像听到她的脚步声了......","id":189},{"type":"dialog","id":190},{"type":"charslot","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"不用担心，梅希亚会帮我们解决这个小问题。","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"小梅，小梅！","id":195},{"type":"dialog","id":196},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","volume":"1","id":197},{"type":"interlude","maskid":"group_interclude_vertical_common","size":"290,760","style":"0","switch":"true","offset":"250,0","channel":"3","tsfrom":"0,1","tsto":"1,1","tsduration":"0.5","id":198},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","pfrom":"280,0","pto":"280,0","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":199},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":201},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"true","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"......啊，听得到，高登长官。","id":203},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"false","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你那边怎么样？要是计划失败，就算是出面硬拖，也得把娜斯提拖住。","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":207},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"true","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您放心，长官。","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"就是因为我的疏忽，所以才出了那么多意外......","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"我一定会盯紧娜斯提主任，确保她离开莱茵生态园，为你们争取尽可能多的时间。","id":211},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"false","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"很好。","id":214},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","id":216},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","tsfrom":"1,1","tsto":"0,1","tsduration":"0.5","id":217},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":218},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"看看，关键时刻连小梅都变得靠谱起来了。","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你们俩给我上点心，快到运输口了。","id":223},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"charslot","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"知道了，长官。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":228},{"type":"charslot","id":229},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":230},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":231},{"type":"charslot","id":232},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":233},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"费尔南小姐的听觉真是敏锐啊。","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"梅希亚小姐，您的身份可能会暴露，需要我们以应急管理监督协会的身份出面干预吗？","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#15$1","focus":"r","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"把梅兰德的招牌用在更重要的地方吧，高登长官的秘书是个很好用的幌子，我这里不用费心。","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"报告情况。","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅兰德特工","text":"根据二组白天收集到的情报，莱茵的技术人员确实撤出了实验区，只有娜斯提主任和一名助手出入这个场馆，只不过......","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"她待在这里的时间长到令人费解。","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅兰德特工","text":"......是的。","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅兰德特工","text":"抱歉，作为您的小队成员，我们应该更信任您的判断，莱茵生命可能确实在展馆地下藏了什么东西。","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#14$1","focus":"r","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"不用道歉，监视各家科技公司本来就是我的任务。","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2046_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅兰德特工","text":"如果我们要进一步搜查，娜斯提主任那边......","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"放心，依我的计划，如果一切顺利，保守估计能为我们争取二十分钟的调查时间。","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#17$1","focus":"r","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"我准备了一份，她无法拒绝的礼物。","id":259},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":260},{"type":"dialog","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":263},{"type":"charslot","id":264},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_bg_38_g5_rhinelab_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":266},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":267},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":268},{"type":"playsound","key":"$keyboard","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":270},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_aircraftalarm","volume":"0.2","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":272},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":274},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"......","id":276},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":277,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"啊啊——！","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"再来一次。","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"娜斯提主任，生态园和浮空种植单元的程序就是用这套系统实现的？","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"虽然隔空控制物体是女妖之所长，但放弃以声音作为媒介，将咒言封存在模块之中，依靠自循环修复漏洞，可是划时代的发明！","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"要是全由咒言驱动......","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"少看一些纯是猜想的论文，斯凯。","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"包含我在内的大多数人对女妖的了解有限，我听说她们栖居在河谷之中，很少离开......","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"来哥伦比亚历练之前，你也待在那里？","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我最初的记忆来源于卡兹戴尔，后来我被同族收养，被带回了河谷。","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"那是个怎样的地方？","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"与世无争的好地方。","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"河流边的草地和丛林茂密，花朵不败，果实不落。不说天灾，连雨水都极少侵扰它的安宁。","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"既然如此，你为什么要走呢？","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"......","id":305},{"type":"dialog","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":307},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":308},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"这么晚了，是谁？","id":311},{"type":"dialog","id":312},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":314},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":315},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"主、主任，快过来！","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"这是不是你丢的那支骨笔？","id":319},{"type":"dialog","id":320},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"charslot","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":324},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_bg_29_g4_corridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":325},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":326},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":327},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"是那支骨笔......的一部分。","id":331},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"text","text":"娜斯提和斯凯脚边，被切断的锥形笔尖在地上来回滚动。","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":335},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","isblock":"true","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"太过分了......","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"生态园的事故不是意外也不是谁的恶作剧，一切都是有备而来。针对你，或是针对莱茵。","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"有一种方法可以把事情弄清楚。","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"（萨卡兹语）指引。","id":344},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_1","volume":"0.6","id":345},{"type":"dialog","id":346},{"type":"charslot","id":347},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.4","block":"true","id":348},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":349},{"type":"text","text":"娜斯提手中的残片应咒言飘浮起来，莹白的光晕包裹着破碎的骨笔。锥形笔尖打转了几圈之后，向某个方向缓缓飞去。","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#11$1","isblock":"true","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"看来另一截骨笔离此不远。","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"主任......","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"这确实有可能是个圈套，但我有不得不去的理由。","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"这支骨笔上......有我熟悉的咒言的痕迹。","id":360},{"type":"dialog","id":361},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":362},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":363},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":364},{"type":"charslot","id":365},{"type":"background","id":366},{"type":"image","id":367}],"characters":["？？？","疲惫的女声","梅希亚","拂哀菈","费尔南","奥克里","高登","梅兰德特工","斯凯","娜斯提"]}